    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Daily simulation game with Breasted Robot</h2><br>Six months after escaping from the basement - I started a sweet routine with a service doll\uff0c Aisha\uff01<br>Come and experience the shameless life under the same roof as Aisha\uff0c the breast-expanding robot\uff01<br>The sequel to the critically acclaimed \u201cEscape from the Room of the Serving Doll\u201d\uff01<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651420/extras/ac304b7aa1aa64d1a051d36b4e0319b3.avif?t=1754463640\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Shake boobs\uff01 Breasts 3D animation</h2><br>Like its predecessor\uff0c H-Scene is a 3D film created by the master of \u6843\u5c71\u30d7\u30ed\u30c0\u30af\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\uff01<br>Enjoy the stunning breast animation\uff01<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651420/extras/c49f016d742b5f9921d2e7478b1376bd.avif?t=1754463640\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0And many more exciting events\uff01</h2>Not just animation\uff01 We have lots of H events in store for you\uff01<br>In the living room\uff0c kitchen\uff0c bathroom\uff0c toilet ...... And even on the beach\uff01<br>Let Aisha\uff0c who has an insatiable appetite\uff0c serve you with all her might\uff01<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651420/extras/ef76ad4365b19901dddac80308d695d6.avif?t=1754463640\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Brain Teaser\uff1f Take on the challenge and solve the puzzles\uff01</h2><br>Will there be times when Aisha asks you to solve puzzles in your daily life\uff1f Aisha loves puzzles\uff0c so try to solve them\uff01 You might get a bonus from Aisha for a perfect answer\uff1f The escape elements of the first game carry over perfectly into the sequel\uff01<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651420/extras/a54ef27a6072c6d55674b9face6dac5f.avif?t=1754463640\" width=622 height=350 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0And then the following story ......\uff1f</h2><br>It also leaves the door open for the next instalment.<br>Appearance of service dolls other than Aisha ......\uff1f<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2651420/extras/939bb5099d00ae0f28128b62c4a95129.avif?t=1754463640\" width=622 height=350 /></span>",
